🧱 6. Company yaratish flow

User landingda signup qiladi

Company yaratiladi

Subdomain tekshiriladi (unique)

Admin user yaratiladi

Redirect:

https://firma.stockfirm.uz
⚙️ 7. NGINX konfiguratsiya (yangilangan)
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name stockfirm.uz www.stockfirm.uz *.stockfirm.uz;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8000;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    }
}
